"\n"
"Yes! And Bézout's identity gives us exactly the proof. Since §5 and §6 are coprime, we know §7. The §8 from this identity is exactly the inverse we are looking for.\n"
"\n"
"Use §9 to extract Bézout's coefficients, and then use algebra!"
