"If a difference §3 is a multiple of §4 (§5), it must logically be a multiple of §6 and a multiple of §7.\n"
"So if two numbers are congruent modulo 15, they are automatically congruent modulo 3 and modulo 5.\n"
"This is a crucial stepping stone towards the Chinese Remainder Theorem!"
